	"Author": "deffiliation",
	"Description": "[size=3]At one point during the fall or winter, you will be given a crock and two kimchi-base recipes from mom.\n<br />You can purchase the crock blueprint from Robin and recipes from Gus any time after year 1.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][size=4]Crock[/size]\n<br />[/list][size=3]By placing any vegetables(except wheat and unmilled rice) and 2 peppers in the crock you can start the fermentation process\n<br />and will be able to harvest kimchi in 5 days.[/size]\n<br />   \uFEFF\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][size=4]Kimchi[/size]\n<br />[/list][size=3]When the kimchi is produced, the name of the product will follow its base item similar to the wine. The price of the kimchi will also be determined by the base crop value.\u00A0[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][size=4]Recipes[/size]\n<br />[/list][size=3]2 kimchi based recipes are added with the initial release.[/size]",
